{"login": "aftershavetf2", "location": null, "commits": [{"sha": "9178de52adc4fc20783ac382ca5f0b91dbb1bcbd", "message": "Use SteamID and name in SetPlayerFlag events\n\nChange AppEventMsg::SetPlayerFlag to carry a SteamID and player name instead of a full Player struct. Update callers and handlers: GUI broadcasts now send steamid and name; Tf2bdThread matches the new event shape and updated set_player_flag signature; RulesetHandler.set_player_flags now accepts a SteamID and optional name and updates internal maps accordingly. Also apply minor formatting/refactor fixes in reputation_thread. This decouples the event bus from the full Player model and reduces payload/borrowing complexity.", "created_at": "2026-03-23T18:43:56Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d13cd61800e61c979710dd0c6d7f72add08b2710", "message": "Preserve known friendships when fetching friends\n\nMerge previously observed friendship records from the database into the live Steam friend list so players cannot hide historical relationships by clearing their Steam friends. Changed the initial DB query flag to false and introduced display_friends (a clone of the API result) that is extended with stored friendship entries mapped to SteamID before sending to the UI; database persistence of the fresh friendship data is retained.", "created_at": "2026-03-23T18:30:17Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d95896a2b7d434daa1d2eb3198bd6e7ce304e2cf", "message": "Return SourceBans fetch result and persist\n\nRefactor SourceBans fetching and reputation caching/persistence:\n\n- Added SourceBanFetchResult to sourcebans and changed get_source_bans to return bans plus successful_sources instead of just Vec<SourceBan>. Logs now warn when all sources fail.\n- Updated get_reputation to return Option<Reputation>; it returns None when no SourceBans sources succeeded to avoid creating false/empty reputations.\n- In ReputationThread, added load_reputation_from_db and persist_reputation helpers. On cache miss, try loading from DB first; when fetching from sources, cache and persist results only if at least one source succeeded. Removed inline DB insert/update code and centralized persistence.\n\nThese changes improve handling of network/source failures, avoid overwriting cache with invalid data, and consolidate DB persistence logic.", "created_at": "2026-03-23T18:16:08Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "99cefd3650a47f4a9e0a05f7cbbae4151b61473b", "message": "Update PROBLEMS.md", "created_at": "2026-03-23T17:56:17Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "652543bba1e8cf64080dcba50058faec0c24d438", "message": "Update player_database_window.rs", "created_at": "2026-03-23T17:56:13Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a054d60d707980d7d38644daca7cf5f7a34271c2", "message": "Update steamapi_thread.rs", "created_at": "2026-03-23T17:56:10Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "74f9189a863e6a3d1d3d5843f72b3ebd73c2da1b", "message": "Create PROBLEMS.md", "created_at": "2026-03-12T20:39:48Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a9424023cb43a431f7d97c21c3b09a89af8325c5", "message": "Add Player Database window and queries\n\nIntroduce a new Player Database UI to browse and filter accounts and player flags. Adds get_all_accounts and get_all_player_flags DB queries (with ordering), a new src/gui/player_database_window.rs implementing search, attribute filters, flag grouping/formatting, and double-click to open player details. Wire the window into the top menu and AppWin state by adding player_database_window_open, player_database_filters, and player_database_search fields and initializing defaults. Includes basic DB error handling when loading accounts/flags.", "created_at": "2026-03-12T20:39:13Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cb7557d7bfa972ece283dfc9f9ee201dc7fd7283", "message": "Clippy fixes", "created_at": "2026-03-11T14:59:21Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f6b4f58af2664253bb9d7e6a936d3a8ef350ffcf", "message": "Added popup player details window", "created_at": "2026-03-11T14:40:31Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c6a89496e6d10718bdc25f0b2007d49568d67314", "message": "Upgrade pkgs", "created_at": "2026-03-11T13:50:53Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f44b95292af9252fd0dc51c88303d6bf14a6d377", "message": "Update Cargo.toml", "created_at": "2026-03-10T19:42:13Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3689c1a9c31fb1591d7557df8bafe22a983093fe", "message": "Bump tf2monitor version to 0.1.10\n\nIncrement package version in Cargo.toml to 0.1.10 and update Cargo.lock to match. This updates the project metadata for the new patch release.", "created_at": "2026-03-08T10:58:37Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "570d7a2df9113b3c2ac36d93042a529a3049d9eb", "message": "Moved NEW and VAC to the reputation column", "created_at": "2026-03-08T10:57:26Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7135674f7f423fefc1ddc76e21f74bc45671b9ca", "message": "Renamed propertoes", "created_at": "2026-03-04T18:31:58Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "124638d49f22eae88277f03130d5b4f2938657ec", "message": "Update logfile_watcher.rs", "created_at": "2026-02-07T17:26:44Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2350e19d3414f387d248cc75fddbe0fbde48314b", "message": "Update logfile_watcher.rs", "created_at": "2026-02-06T18:59:58Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b9d0eec622f26ea283e708eebf980ac9caa9b997", "message": "Added database statistics window", "created_at": "2026-01-24T17:37:22Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "04f8181c607799e2824b49f0b01dc23b21ad2073", "message": "Removed manual save/restore of window position/size", "created_at": "2026-01-08T16:40:40Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f54ca7eb9523627941bc42a55278ed1853a3f255", "message": "Bump version to 0.1.9 in Cargo.toml and Cargo.lock\n\nUpdate the tf2monitor package version from 0.1.8 to 0.1.9 in both Cargo.toml and Cargo.lock. Minor formatting adjustments were also made to the eframe dependency features list.", "created_at": "2026-01-08T16:00:41Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2c95900a339a87b02b43486c841785612279414f", "message": "Update app_settings.rs", "created_at": "2026-01-08T15:59:01Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c7b4b9eddbbd08454b856e592908547ac8943a19", "message": "Update steamapi_thread.rs", "created_at": "2026-01-08T15:57:02Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "eaddaf33ba755611f0d2e06c2e0f9f11f19f9fcf", "message": "Update app_settings.rs", "created_at": "2026-01-08T15:55:12Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cfc81140ea69ebdb2c948a66cfd38f1c8d6087c7", "message": "Enable X11 and Wayland support in eframe\n\nAdded 'x11' and 'wayland' features to the eframe dependency in Cargo.toml to support both major Linux display servers. Updated Cargo.lock to include new dependencies required for these features.", "created_at": "2026-01-08T15:48:51Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9aa5ef23aa54d791f041f7af47742d014a4dc10c", "message": "Enable eframe persistence feature\n\nAdded the 'persistence' feature to the eframe dependency in Cargo.toml. This allows the application to support state persistence, and updates Cargo.lock with new and updated dependencies required for this feature.", "created_at": "2026-01-08T15:42:56Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0f6a9f847c8765dad82bc55c893b106596459d96", "message": "Update serde_json and remove pollster dependency\n\nBumped serde_json from 1.0.148 to 1.0.149 and removed the unused pollster dependency. Also updated the Rust edition to 2024 in Cargo.toml.", "created_at": "2026-01-08T15:28:26Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "43b878bcacdc408d4def82f6db99b7a27d18c5a3", "message": "Update config.rs", "created_at": "2026-01-08T11:10:19Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0b8e1fb6babb7b3b5e138271ef00ead7680cdef3", "message": "Update steamapi_thread.rs", "created_at": "2026-01-08T11:05:15Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ff6a28f10339be4dfde997dcdbad301be827c675", "message": "Update config.rs", "created_at": "2026-01-08T10:58:18Z", "repo": "TF2Monitor", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ba878dcf50e86db5f879ae1ca812dd150b10b2aa", "message": "Removed the use of SteamApiCache", "created_at": "2026-01-08T10:51:54Z", "repo